The completed center calculation gives T_C = Z(L) = ⟨z⟩ with order two.
The checked field and graph endgames turn constructed local geometry into
a residual fusion witness, forbidden by (!) and the earlier residual placement.
In the graph endgame the actual conjugation action gives its exact fixed axis
and [N_{T_L}(V),r] = U; no fusion witness is assumed there.

The compatible field parabolics and their two-core conjugacy, and the graph
